{"question_id":"QDEV001","answer":"格式为 G90 X(U)_ Z(W)_ F_。X、Z表示圆柱面切削终点的绝对坐标；U、W表示该终点相对循环起点的增量坐标；F表示进给量。","evidence_ids":["EDEV001"],"answer_type":"definitive","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV002","answer":"R表示锥体大小端的半径差，不是直径差，并按右端面延伸后的切削起点考虑。锥面起点坐标大于终点坐标时R取正值，反之取负值。","evidence_ids":["EDEV002"],"answer_type":"conditional","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV003","answer":"G71用于按给定背吃刀量重复进行外径粗车或内径粗镗，并按轮廓程序完成粗加工、保留精加工余量；G70在G71之后按P、Q指定的轮廓范围进行精车，切除这部分余量。","evidence_ids":["EDEV003"],"answer_type":"comparative","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV004","answer":"G73主要适合已经铸造或锻造成形、轮廓接近成品的毛坯粗加工。一般不用于圆棒料，因为会产生较多空行程，效率较低。","evidence_ids":["EDEV004"],"answer_type":"conditional","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV005","answer":"G76采用两行参数。第一行中的m是精车重复次数，r是螺纹尾端倒角量，α是刀尖角度，Δdmin是最小切深，d是精车余量。第二行中的X、Z是螺纹切削终点坐标，i是螺纹两端半径差，k是螺纹高度，Δd是第一刀车削深度，L是螺纹导程。","evidence_ids":["EDEV005A","EDEV005B"],"answer_type":"definitive","safety_level":"requires_caution","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV006","answer":"M98的格式为 M98 P_ L_。P表示要调用的子程序号，L表示重复调用次数；只调用一次时L1可以省略。","evidence_ids":["EDEV006"],"answer_type":"definitive","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV007","answer":"G17选择XOY平面，G18选择XOZ平面，G19选择YOZ平面。","evidence_ids":["EDEV007"],"answer_type":"definitive","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV008","answer":"沿刀具前进方向看，G41是左刀补，刀具中心轨迹位于被加工面的左边；G42是右刀补，轨迹位于右边；G40用于取消刀具半径补偿。","evidence_ids":["EDEV008"],"answer_type":"comparative","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV009","answer":"建立和取消刀补时必须有补偿平面坐标轴的移动，移动距离还必须大于刀具半径补偿值。通常在切入工件前建立刀补、切出工件后取消刀补，并选择不会与工件干涉的进刀和退刀路线。","evidence_ids":["EDEV009"],"answer_type":"procedural","safety_level":"requires_caution","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV010","answer":"G00用于快速点定位，速度和运动轨迹由系统决定，轨迹不一定是单一直线；G01用于直线插补，刀具按F指定的进给速度沿直线移到终点。本页中F的单位为mm/min，并在新的F指令出现前保持有效。","evidence_ids":["EDEV010"],"answer_type":"comparative","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV011","answer":"G90循环按A→B→C→D→A运动：A→B快速进刀到切削起点，相当于G00；B→C切削到终点，相当于G01；C→D退刀，相当于G01；D→A快速返回循环起点，相当于G00。","evidence_ids":["EDEV011"],"answer_type":"procedural","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV012","answer":"循环起点A通常选在距工件右端面约2mm、距外圆面约5mm的位置，分别留出安全距离和退刀距离。","evidence_ids":["EDEV012"],"answer_type":"conditional","safety_level":"requires_caution","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV013","answer":"格式为 G92 X(U)_ Z(W)_ R_ F_。X、Z是螺纹切削终点坐标，U、W是终点相对循环起点的坐标，F是螺距。","evidence_ids":["EDEV013"],"answer_type":"definitive","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV014","answer":"加工圆柱螺纹时R为0，可以省略。加工圆锥螺纹时，R表示考虑导入和导出空刀量后的起点、终点半径差；起点坐标大于终点坐标时取正，否则取负。","evidence_ids":["EDEV014"],"answer_type":"conditional","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV015","answer":"A→B进刀使用G00，B→C螺纹切削使用G32，C→D退刀使用G00，D→A返回循环起点使用G00；用循环方式时由G92完成这四步。","evidence_ids":["EDEV015"],"answer_type":"procedural","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV016","answer":"G71第二行的U是径向背吃刀量、R是径向退刀量，二者都是半径值。第三行的P和Q是轮廓开始、结束程序段号，U是X向精加工余量且为直径值，W是Z向精加工余量，F是切削进给量。","evidence_ids":["EDEV016"],"answer_type":"definitive","safety_level":"requires_caution","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV017","answer":"应先检查G70的快速退刀路线，通常采用粗加工循环中的循环起点。书中示例从A点执行安全，从B点执行会发生碰撞。","evidence_ids":["EDEV017"],"answer_type":"conditional","safety_level":"requires_caution","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV018","answer":"粗加工时以G71程序段中的F、S、T为准；循环引用的轮廓程序段中的F、S、T即使写了也不生效，但它们对精加工有效。精加工未另行指定时，继续使用粗加工值。","evidence_ids":["EDEV018"],"answer_type":"conditional","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV019","answer":"G73第二行的U是X向最大切削深度，取半径值；R是循环次数。第三行P和Q是轮廓开始、结束段号，U是X向精加工余量且取直径值，W是Z向精加工余量，F是切削进给量。","evidence_ids":["EDEV019"],"answer_type":"definitive","safety_level":"requires_caution","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV020","answer":"G76常用于没有退刀槽的圆柱或圆锥螺纹。它采用多次自动循环斜进法，可单侧刀刃切削，并使吃刀量逐渐减小，有利于保护刀具、提高螺纹精度和自动分层加工。","evidence_ids":["EDEV020"],"answer_type":"definitive","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV021","answer":"m是精车重复次数，范围00～99，必须写两位数，一般取01～03。r是螺纹尾端倒角量，范围00～99，通常取00～20，单位为0.1倍螺距P，也必须写两位数。","evidence_ids":["EDEV021"],"answer_type":"definitive","safety_level":"requires_caution","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV022","answer":"α表示刀尖角度，以两位数输入；Δdmin表示最小切深，单位为μm、取半径值；d表示精车余量，同样以μm为单位并取半径值。书中给出的Δdmin和d常用范围均为50～100μm。","evidence_ids":["EDEV022"],"answer_type":"definitive","safety_level":"requires_caution","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV023","answer":"G90表示绝对坐标值编程，G91表示相对坐标值编程。两者都是模态指令，同一程序段只能使用一种，不能混用。","evidence_ids":["EDEV023"],"answer_type":"comparative","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV024","answer":"轮廓铣削时，刀具中心轨迹会因刀具半径而偏离零件轮廓。使用半径补偿后可以直接按零件轮廓编程，由数控系统自动计算刀具中心轨迹，从而减少人工计算。","evidence_ids":["EDEV024"],"answer_type":"definitive","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV025","answer":"D是刀具半径补偿功能字，后两位表示补偿编号，该编号对应存储的刀具半径补偿值。D00也可以用于取消刀具半径补偿。","evidence_ids":["EDEV025"],"answer_type":"definitive","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV026","answer":"刀具半径大于内轮廓转角允许的半径时可能在转角处过切；刀具直径大于沟槽宽度时也会在沟槽加工中发生过切。","evidence_ids":["EDEV026"],"answer_type":"conditional","safety_level":"requires_caution","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV027","answer":"刀具磨损或重磨后，只需更新补偿表中的刀具半径，不必修改程序。用半径R的同一刀具粗精加工、精加工余量为Δ时，粗加工补偿设为R+Δ，精加工补偿设为R。","evidence_ids":["EDEV027"],"answer_type":"procedural","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV028","answer":"因为G00的速度和轨迹由系统决定，轨迹通常不是一条直线，而可能是几段直线的组合。如果只按起点和终点判断空间是否安全，刀具中途可能与工件或机床碰撞。","evidence_ids":["EDEV028"],"answer_type":"conditional","safety_level":"requires_caution","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV029","answer":"F表示进给速度，本页单位为mm/min。F是模态指令，在出现新的F值以前持续有效，因此不必在每个G01程序段中重复写。","evidence_ids":["EDEV029"],"answer_type":"definitive","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
{"question_id":"QDEV030","answer":"G02是顺时针圆弧插补，G03是逆时针圆弧插补。R表示圆弧半径：圆心角不大于180度时取正，大于180度时取负。I、J、K表示圆心相对圆弧起点的增量坐标，与G90、G91无关；若R与I、J、K同时给出，R优先。","evidence_ids":["EDEV030"],"answer_type":"definitive","safety_level":"safe","requires_confirmation":false,"annotation_status":"reviewed"}
